    "anchors_resolve": "pass \u2014 `reckon/crew_follow_commands.py`, `FOLLOWER_RESUME_EVENT` (line 443, branch at 3276), `_follow_replay_visible` (2644) and `_replayed_row_repeats_the_pane` (1350) all resolve, as do `StationStore.at_runtime_root` and `read_cursor` (station_store.py:341, 824); the \"near line\" figures are within the stated tolerance.",
    "done_when": "finding \u2014 the done-when's independent reference names \"the runs `reckon crew view live` lists for the session as live or queued\", but that view narrows to a session only with `mine` and applies no phase filter, so the invocation the sentence suggests does not return the set it claims.",
    "evidence_paths": "pass \u2014 the section names no evidence or log path; its gate is a new test in the repository's test directory, and nothing it asks for lands in a scratchpad.",
