    "reasoning": "finding \u2014 the section asserts that the snapshot's run set and its reference \"must be equal\", but `crew view obligations` also carries duties that belong to the project rather than to any run, so the equality it promises does not hold on the real code path unless the reference is explicitly narrowed to run-scoped duties.",
    "single_goal": "pass \u2014 one deliverable, the framed state snapshot printed in place of nothing on a pipe resume.",
    "wiring": "pass \u2014 s124 declares no new relationship and consumes only work already landed (s122 is `done`), so nothing it needs is missing."
